config-connector-extensions patch 0006: mockgcp serves IAM workload identity pool namespaces.

For iam.gcp.hfl.dev IAMWorkloadIdentityPoolNamespace.
- mockgcp/apis/mockgcp/iam/v1/workload_identity_pool_namespace.proto is
  Config Connector pull request #14209's (head a5e8f5a9)
  mockgcp/apis/google/iam/v1/workload_identity_pool_namespace.proto, with
  the package changed to mockgcp.iam.v1;
- generated/mockgcp/iam/v1/workload_identity_pool_namespace*.go are
  generated from it by hack/regen-mockiam-namespaces.sh with mockgcp's
  toolchain;
- mockiam/workloadidentitypoolnamespaces.go, written here, serves get,
  create, patch (description, disabled), delete (a soft delete: state
  DELETED, expireTime in 30 days, the ID not reusable), undelete and list,
  each change as a long-running operation; service.go registers it and the
  /v1/.../operations/{name} path.
The parent workload identity pool is not checked: mockgcp has no pools.
Upstream candidate: yes, with the PR.

